WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — ai-coding-market (30s) Narrator Osato

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:03.856
Headline reports project a trillion-dollar AI coding market

2
00:00:03.856 --> 00:00:07.574
by multiplying global developer salaries by adoption guesses.

3
00:00:07.994 --> 00:00:12.075
Those revenue models quietly assume every future edit, test,

4
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:15.883
and migration calls a massive billed model from scratch.

5
00:00:16.303 --> 00:00:22.459
Just as open compilers and libraries captured trillions in value without charging per compile,

6
00:00:22.459 --> 00:00:24.882
verified reuse crushes marginal cost.

7
00:00:25.302 --> 00:00:28.872
When checked solutions are saved once and replayed locally,

8
00:00:28.872 --> 00:00:32.019
repeated coding work trends toward electricity cost.
